This product has since been almost entirely rewritten: about 93% of the
integration's code and over 97% of the repository is new. What survives from the
original is mostly structure: the module layout, the hub's endpoint paths and
registration handshake, the data model, and the outline of the config flow and
cover entity. Everything else is new work, including the radio pacing and command
watchdog, the wake sweep, every entity platform other than `cover`, the dashboard
card, the actions, the diagnostics, the translations, and the test suite.

